{
  "id": "s1-08",
  "seasonId": "season-1",
  "episodeNumber": 8,
  "title": {
    "en": "I Cried, Cried My Lungs Out, and Stopped Crying"
  },
  "airDate": "2016-05-22",
  "comments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "Roswaal Mansion, fifth loop start. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734445492919115776",
      "characters": [
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "You all are really staying awake for this—I'm happy.",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734445608375750657",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Doesn't it feel like the opening looks different now than last time and the time before, because of how you're feeling? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734445823535255552",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Pack appears. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734445851112660992",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Not just the opening, the ending is about to go on sale too, so look forward to it! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446045610942464",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Part A starts!! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446091500851200",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "Subaru-kun is more capable now than in the last and the time before last loops. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446177454850048",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "Pack moves around recklessly and constantly. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446461568487425",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "\"Hoh.\" ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446509857505280",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "Myon myon myon myon myon ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446563645218817",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "\"How gloomy.\" ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446628849881088",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "Emilia-tan is cute today too ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446688530620417",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "It's the first Shamak, but for Subaru-kun it overlaps a lot with the penalty, so it feels a little rough. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734446892642230272",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": [
        "Mana & Magic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "In a normal game, buffs and debuffs are insanely strong, but in this world's setting, buffs and debuffs really aren't that big a deal. Usually the difference in raw ability is just too huge. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447071097442308",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "Subaru bursts out ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447130824187904",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "Second time since Episode 5 ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447181701079040",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "Chew and swallow, ready, go♪ ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447365000728577",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "It looks like a pickled plum. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447447276171265",
      "characters": [
        "Plum Risch"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "Probably really bitter. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447489756082176",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "E.M.T. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447555044507649",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "Roswaal and Ram's secret nighttime meeting ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447606512951296",
      "characters": [
        "Ram",
        "Roswaal L. Mathers"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "Betty is dependable today too ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447920808747009",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "Could it be the worst calamity, I wonder? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734447994712428544",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "It feels like the subtle foreshadowing from Episode 1 is being revealed here. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448219275460608",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "Part A is over! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448293355212801",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "Subaru-kun has pulled himself together once more, but what resolve will he start acting on in Part B...? ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448535010050049",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "Please pay attention today as well to the changes in Kobayashi-san's voice. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448675166916609",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "Part B begins ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448713939091456",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "Puck is usually sleepy in the morning. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448825490804737",
      "characters": [
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "Puck was cute just now. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734448906029912064",
      "characters": [
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "Natural, yet unnatural. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734449146535542784",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "I think it's fun just watching Subaru's expressions, too. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734449270640631808",
      "characters": [
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "Rem\nSuspicion【■■■■■■】 ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734449414664802308",
      "characters": [
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "Rem\nSuspicion【■■■■■■■■■■■】 ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734449541420847106",
      "characters": [
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "He'd even sneak into the loot cellar. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734449768265613313",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "Emilia-tan part begins ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734449891347308545",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "text": "The angle looking up from a lap pillow, you know, how do I put it, hehe, it's vulgar, but I really love it. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734450037023875072",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "text": "Emilia's voice here is incredibly gentle. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734450103084191744",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "text": "That must've been hard. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734450264418160640",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 40,
      "text": "Rem\nSuspicion【□□□□□■■■】 ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734450696263729154",
      "characters": [
        "Rem"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "text": "At this point, Emilia's lap pillow has been going for about three or four hours, I guess... ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734450826547232768",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 42,
      "text": "First Beako ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734450894725632000",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 43,
      "text": "The protagonist cries and wails, then enters \"sage\" mode. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734451068268994560",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 44,
      "text": "I love Beako! Beako is cute! Beako is smart! Beako! Beako! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734451330471858176",
      "characters": [
        "Beatrice"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 45,
      "text": "It's a lap pillow. It sure is a lap pillow. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734451462588112896",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 46,
      "text": "This is what they call being surrounded by beauties. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734451781233745920",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 47,
      "text": "Part B is over! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734451854306910208",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 48,
      "text": "Closing Puck ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734452125674020864",
      "characters": [
        "Puck"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 49,
      "text": "As for this week's content, it's exactly what you saw and exactly what was written in the work, so there's nothing in particular to explain. I just hope you enjoyed how Subaru and Emilia were portrayed. Man, that was nice. ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734452421066383360",
      "characters": [
        "Emilia",
        "Natsuki Subaru"
      ],
      "topics": []
    },
    {
      "id": 50,
      "text": "Well then, thanks so much for staying with me so late this week! See you next week... ah, let's meet again next week! Maybe! ",
      "source": "https://x.com/nezumiironyanko/status/734453204679680001",
      "characters": [],
      "topics": []
    }
  ]
}
